  "version": "1.0.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "mean_up_range_20 / mean_down_range_20, where range=(high-low)/close and day direction by close vs open",
    "description": "Ratio of the average intraday range on up days to the average intraday range on down days over a 20-day window. Captures asymmetry in how much volatility is realized on advancing vs declining days; persistent up-day dominance tends to precede positive forward returns in this cross-asset universe."
